<!-- Create PBR Material Button Screenshot -->
]=] .. CreatePBRMaterialImage() .. [=[


<h2>Image Channels</h2>

<p>A Substance &quot;PBR Metal Rough&quot; export workflow is expected by this script. That means you will have a set of texture maps with the following PBR map channels:<p>

<ul>
<li>BaseColor</li>
